# A Script drives a block in test mode, and is still in the window, with its blocks, back in the editor
open-window
new-script Lights
set-text
power_display(1 & 1)
end
compile
expect-result Placed 3 blocks
expect-blocks 3
place-start
test-mode
wait 2
screenshot running
back-to-editor
expect-blocks 3
open-window
select-script Lights
expect-text power_display(1 & 1)
expect-no-errors
screenshot back-in-editor
